
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
  <title>Welcome to Smart Bagha</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f6f9; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#202938;">

  <!-- Preheader -->
  <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0; color:transparent;">
    Welcome to Smart Bagha, <%= name %>! Your journey to saving lives starts here.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"
    style="background-color:#f4f6f9; padding:35px 12px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <!-- Main Card -->
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"
          style="width:100%; max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;">

          <!-- Brand Header -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:30px 24px 24px; background-color:#ffffff;">
              <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td valign="middle" style="padding-right:10px;">
                    <div style="width:42px; height:42px; line-height:42px; text-align:center; border-radius:12px; background-color:#dc2626; color:#ffffff; font-size:25px; font-weight:bold;">
                      +
                    </div>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="middle">
                    <span style="font-size:25px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.7px; color:#111827;">
                      Smart <span style="color:#dc2626;">Bagha</span>
                    </span>
                    <div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:#6b7280; margin-top:3px;">
                      DONATE BLOOD. SAVE LIVES.
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Red Welcome Banner -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:42px 28px 38px; background-color:#dc2626; background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#b91c1c,#ef4444);">
              <div style="width:68px; height:68px; line-height:68px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#ffffff; color:#dc2626; font-size:34px; margin:0 auto 22px;">
                ♥
              </div>

              <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:32px; line-height:1.3; font-weight:800; color:#ffffff;">
                Welcome to Smart Bagha!
              </h1>

              <p style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#fff1f2;">
                You're now part of a community that cares.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Personalized Greeting -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:36px 34px 12px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:17px; line-height:1.7; color:#374151;">
                Hi <strong style="color:#dc2626;"><%= name %></strong>,
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#4b5563;">
                Welcome to <strong style="color:#111827;">Smart Bagha</strong>!
                We're excited to have you with us. Your account has been
                created successfully, and you're ready to become part of
                something meaningful.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#4b5563;">
                Every blood donation can make a real difference. Together,
                we can help connect blood donors with people who need them
                when it matters most.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Mission Highlight -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 34px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"
                style="background-color:#fff5f5; border:1px solid #fee2e2; border-radius:12px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:22px 20px;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color:#b91c1c;">
                      🩸 One community. One mission.
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.8; color:#6b2930;">
                      Be ready to help, spread awareness, and make every
                      drop count. A small act of kindness can mean the
                      world to someone.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:0 30px 34px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 22px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#4b5563;">
                Your journey starts now. Visit Smart Bagha and explore
                how you can make a difference.
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" bgcolor="#dc2626" style="border-radius:8px;">
                    <a href="<%= websiteUrl %>"
                      target="_blank"
                      style="display:inline-block; padding:15px 32px; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:8px;">
                      Explore Smart Bagha &rarr;
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Closing -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:26px 28px; background-color:#f9fafb; border-top:1px solid #f0f1f3;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#374151;">
                Thank you for joining our mission!
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:#6b7280;">
                Together, we can make a difference — one donation at a time.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#9ca3af;">
                &copy; <%= year %> Smart Bagha. All rights reserved.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:8px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#9ca3af;">
                This email was sent because an account was created using this email address.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

        <p style="margin:20px 0 0; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; color:#9ca3af; text-align:center;">
          Smart Bagha · Connecting donors, supporting lives.
        </p>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
```